nodes.title:
Memory keeps a person's words only as long as it says it does. The nightly job memory.retention (03:10 IST, memory/retention.ts) deletes for good:
- facts past expires_at (call_to_call 30 days, durable 365 days from when said);
- review-tier proposals nobody approved within 14 days;
- memory_extraction receipts older than the workspace's transcripts window.
An older value superseded by a deleted fact stays superseded, so nothing resurfaces. Each workspace gets one audit row per run (actor memory.retention, action memory.retention_sweep) that carries counts only {expired, unreviewed, extractions}, and none when nothing went. memory.policy.get returns retention {rules, dueNow, lastSweep}.
